@startuml
title Clipboard Ingest Flow (Minimal)

cloud "wl-paste --watch" as WLP
node "pyClipScratch\n(processor)" as Proc
database "MySQL\nentry table" as DB
rectangle "Client app\n(reads entries)" as Client
actor User

WLP --> Proc : pipe raw clipboard\n(text or image blob)
Proc --> DB : insert processed fields\n(text, metadata, blobs)
User --> Client : request specific entry/table
Client --> DB : SELECT rows
DB --> Client : result set

note right of Proc
  Detect MIME, branch to text or image path,
  decode text or extract EXIF/OCR for images,
  then persist all fields (NULLs allowed).
end note

@enduml
